      "trackName": "DPF Monitor for VAG",
      "releaseNotes": "Added dark mode!\nAdded CHNC, CZZA, DCPC, DTRE, and DGDA as known engines.\nAdded BETA Group 17 for 4.2 TDI engines with dual-DPFs.\nAdded BETA Group 18 for CVUA/CVUB/CVUC.\nAdded BETA Group 19 for CDSB and CUDC.\nAdded \"Soot Mass Measured\" to Group 7.\nAdded Post Injection values to Group 16.\nAdded Bank 2 Output Temperature to Group 18.\nUpdated German translations for push notifications.\nFix regen duration for Group 2.\nFixed DPF temperatures for Group 9.\nFixed DPF Output Temperature in Group 18\nFixed \"Differential Pressure\" in Group 7.\nFixed \"Time Since Regeneration\" for Group 8.\nFixed Input Gas Temperature and Differential Pressure in Group 13.",
